Note on content vs. code

The MIT License above covers the *code* in this repository — the React
components, build scripts, Cloudflare Pages Function, generation pipelines,
and supporting tooling. Fork it, adapt it, and use it for your own résumé
or any other purpose.

The *content* of the résumé itself — the prose, professional history, named
clients and engagements, contact information, and any text or imagery
specifically about Leif Taylor — is not part of the MIT-licensed software.
That content is provided for reading and verification by employers,
recruiters, and collaborators, and is not licensed for redistribution,
republication, or reuse. Please respect that distinction when adapting the
codebase: take the patterns, leave the words.
